    "standardized_narrative": "Syndicate 2623 recorded a material prior-year reserve release in 2021 amounting to $150.8m (a c.3.5% release of opening gross claims outstanding of $4,309.9m). The releases were largely driven by favourable claims development across multiple divisions (notably Marine, Property, Specialty and Cyber), and were augmented by a 90% Loss Portfolio Transfer in the Property engineering classes which contributed to a sizeable component of the release. Prior volatility arose from large natural catastrophe events and COVID-19 related losses in earlier years, but overall the net impact for 2021 was a release of prior-year reserves.",
